<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS ADD UP</view><view class="title">每一点，都算数。</view><view class="subtitle">只和过去的自己比较。</view><view class="card"><view>本周回顾</view><view class="caption">{{weekLabel}}</view><view class="row space"><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{week.complete}}<text class="small"> / {{week.training}}</text></view><view class="muted">完成训练</view></view><view class="metric"><view class="big">{{week.recorded}}<text class="small"> / {{week.mealTotal}}</text></view><view class="muted">记录餐次</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="small">训练完成率 {{week.trainingRate === null ? '暂无计划' : week.trainingRate + '%'}} · 部分完成 {{week.partial}} 次</view><view class="small muted">饮食记录率 {{week.mealRate === null ? '暂无计划' : week.mealRate + '%'}}，不是达标率。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="row"><button class="link" bindtap="month" data-offset="-1">‹ 上月</button><text>{{month}}</text><button class="link" bindtap="month" data-offset="1">下月 ›</button></view><view class="calendar"><view wx:for="{{['日','一','二','三','四','五','六']}}" wx:key="*this" class="calendar-cell muted">{{item}}</view><view wx:for="{{calendar}}" wx:key="id" class="calendar-cell {{selected === item.date ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="select" data-date="{{item.date}}"><block wx:if="{{!item.blank}}"><view>{{item.number}}</view><view class="small">{{item.training}} {{item.meal}}</view></block></view></view><view class="caption">✓ 完成 · 半 部分完成 · 记 其他训练记录 · 休 恢复日 · 餐 饮食已记录</view></view>
<view class="section">{{selected}} 的记录</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{day}}"><view class="row list-item" bindtap="workout"><text>{{day.title}}</text><text class="tag">{{day.status}} ›</text></view><view wx:for="{{day.meals}}" wx:key="id" class="row list-item" bindtap="meal" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.recorded ? '已记录 · 编辑' : '未记录 · 补记'}} ›</text></view></view><view class="card empty" wx:else>这天没有计划记录。</view>
<view class="section">体重趋势</view><view class="card"><view class="muted small">最近 7 次记录 · 单位 kg · 局部范围显示</view><view wx:if="{{weights.length}}" class="weight-bars"><view class="weight-col" wx:for="{{weights}}" wx:key="date"><view>{{item.value}}</view><view class="weight-bar" style="height:{{item.height}}rpx"></view><view>{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">记录一次，开始了解自己的变化。</view><view class="caption" wx:if="{{weights.length === 1}}">只有一次记录，还不足以判断趋势。</view><view class="row space"><picker mode="date" value="{{weightDate}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="date"><text class="pill">{{weightDate}} ▾</text></picker><input type="digit" placeholder="体重 kg" value="{{weightValue}}" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="dark space" bindtap="saveWeight">保存体重 / 更新当天记录</button><view wx:for="{{weights}}" wx:key="date" class="row list-item"><text>{{item.date}} · {{item.value}} kg</text><button class="link" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="editWeight">编辑</button><button class="link" data-date="{{item.date}}" bindtap="deleteWeight">删除</button></view></view><view class="footer-note">体重只是一个维度，感受与习惯同样重要。</view></view>
